{"id":"78e9f5360084d5ed","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/305_λβη-演算.md","title":"305 λβη-演算","display":"305_λβη-演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"305-λβη-演算\">305 λβη-演算</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始项语言\">1. 原始项语言</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\beta\\eta}(X)=x_m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\beta\\eta}(X)=x_m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_m\\notin X\">\\(x_m\\notin X\\)</span> 的最小自然数。</p>\n<p>项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\qquad \\operatorname{app},\\qquad \\operatorname{lam}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\qquad \\operatorname{app},\\qquad \\operatorname{lam}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"2.-上下文、自由变量与替换\">2. 上下文、自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>一孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 由下列闭包生成：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}(C,M)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}(C,M)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}(M,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}(M,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 对四个上下文构造子分别满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{hole},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{hole},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{appL}(C,N),M)=\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M),N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{appL}(C,N),M)=\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M),N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{appR}(N,C),M)=\n\\operatorname{app}(N,\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{appR}(N,C),M)=\n\\operatorname{app}(N,\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C),M)=\n\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C),M)=\n\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}:\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}:\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。</p>\n<p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}:\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}:\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>捕获避免替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]\">\\(M[x:=N]\\)</span> 的定义域和值域为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\beta\\eta}:\n\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\beta\\eta}:\n\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\to\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(P,Q)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(P[x:=N],Q[x:=N]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(P,Q)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(P[x:=N],Q[x:=N]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(x,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(x,P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(x,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(x,P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(y,P[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(y,P[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\beta\\eta}\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\beta\\eta}\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,(P[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,(P[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}\\subseteq\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}\\subseteq\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\times\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 的交集，其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_0,M_1)\\in E\">\\((M_0,M_1)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N_0,N_1)\\in E\">\\((N_0,N_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{app}(M_0,N_0),\\operatorname{app}(M_1,N_1))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{app}(M_0,N_0),\\operatorname{app}(M_1,N_1))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"3\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_0,M_1)\\in E\">\\((M_0,M_1)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M_0),\\operatorname{lam}(x,M_1))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M_0),\\operatorname{lam}(x,M_1))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"4\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-$\\beta$-与-$\\eta$-基本约化\">4. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 基本约化</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N),M[x:=N]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N),M[x:=N]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义外延基本约化</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x))),M):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x))),M):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\eta\">\\(\\beta\\eta\\)</span> 约化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ (M,N)\\in\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ (M,N)\\in\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限约化证书集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\,n&gt;0}\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}^{n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\,n&gt;0}\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}^{n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\">\\(\\rho=(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(M_i\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1&lt;n\">\\(i+1&lt;n\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(M_i,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\quad\\text{或}\\quad\nM_i\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}M_{i+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(M_i,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\quad\\text{或}\\quad\nM_i\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}M_{i+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\twoheadrightarrow_{\\beta\\eta}N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\twoheadrightarrow_{\\beta\\eta}N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\rho=(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_0=M,\\qquad M_{n-1}=N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_0=M,\\qquad M_{n-1}=N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-等式公理与规则\">5. 等式公理与规则</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq M:M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq M:M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta}N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N)\\doteq M[x:=N]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N)\\doteq M[x:=N]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x)))\\doteq M:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x)))\\doteq M:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),N\\doteq M):M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),N\\doteq M):M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N,N\\doteq P),M\\doteq P):M,N,P\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N,N\\doteq P),M\\doteq P):M,N,P\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)\\doteq\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,M)\\doteq\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象与可导关系\">6. 证明对象与可导关系</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\beta\\eta\">\\(\\lambda\\beta\\eta\\)</span>-证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\">\\((E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n&gt;0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n&gt;0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 行至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(E_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\beta\\eta\">\\(\\lambda\\beta\\eta\\)</span>-证明且末行为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导关系与目标差异\">7. 可导关系与目标差异</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}E\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}E\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\\)</span> 为所有上述有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\beta\\eta\">\\(\\lambda\\beta\\eta\\)</span>-证明序列的集合。无前提原子判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异组件为下列单元素集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta},\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta})\n:\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n\\ \\wedge\\ \n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta},\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta})\n:\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n\\ \\wedge\\ \n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此删除标题后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 根收缩与带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta}(M)\\)</span> 侧条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 根收缩仍同时由对象层数据识别。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\twoheadrightarrow_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\vdash_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\Lambda_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{plug}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\eta}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Step}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{RedCert}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\twoheadrightarrow_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\beta\\eta},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta},\n\\vdash_{\\lambda\\beta\\eta}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\beta\">\\(\\lambda\\beta\\)</span> 增加了带自由变量侧条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 外延公理与约化，并显式给出原子判断集合和目标差异组件；不含求值策略、类型系统、解释结构或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"305-λβη-演算","text":"305 λβη-演算","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始项语言","text":"1. 原始项语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-上下文、自由变量与替换","text":"2. 上下文、自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-$\\beta$-与-$\\eta$-基本约化","text":"4. $\\beta$ 与 $\\eta$ 基本约化","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式公理与规则","text":"5. 等式公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象与可导关系","text":"6. 证明对象与可导关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导关系与目标差异","text":"7. 可导关系与目标差异","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\beta\\eta}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mat